<title>BAHRAIN: Al-Ahli Commercial H1 net profit steady.</title>
<headline>Al-Ahli Commercial H1 net profit steady.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		  (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.768   vs    2.762</p>
<p> Operating income     6.27    vs    5.81</p>
<p> Operating expenses   2.74    vs    2.13</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 42.42    vs   39.28</p>
<p> Assets		 256.03    vs  227.95</p>
<p>Full Name: Al-Ahli Commercial Bank BSC.</p>
<p>Note - Traded on the Bahrain Stock Exchange, the bank is the third largest commercial bank on the island.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
